This extension builds on:

- MOSS-Image for Forge Neo, Copyright 2026 eduardoabreu81, AGPL-3.0
  https://github.com/eduardoabreu81/moss-image-forge-neo
  guy_i2p/qwen35_vl.py follows its Qwen 3.5 language tower (forge_moss/native/qwen35.py), including the chunked
  gated delta rule, and adds decoding, the vision tower, MRoPE image positions and sampling.
- Forge Neo (sd-webui-forge-classic, neo branch), Copyright 2023 AUTOMATIC1111, 2024 lllyasviel and contributors,
  AGPL-3.0. guy_i2p/qwen35_vl.py follows its Qwen 3.5 vision tower (backend/nn/llm/qwen35.py).
- ComfyUI (comfy/text_encoders/qwen35.py, qwen3vl.py), GPL-3.0, which both of the above port.
- Hugging Face Transformers (modeling_qwen3_5, Qwen3-VL image processor and rotary embeddings), Apache-2.0: reference
  for the maths and the image preparation.

Bundled file:

- guy_i2p/qwen35_tokenizer.json: the Qwen 3.5 tokenizer by the Qwen team (Alibaba Cloud), Apache License 2.0
  (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Unchanged.

Model weights are not included; download them separately and follow their own licences.
